{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32173","headline":"寓怀 · 温庭筠","name":"寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诚足不顾得，妄矜徒有言。\n语斯谅未尽，隐显何悠然。\n洵彼都邑盛，眷惟车马喧。\n自期尊客卿，非意干王孙。\n衔知有贞爵，处实非厚颜。\n苟无海岱气，奚取壶浆恩。\n唯丝南山杨，适我松菊香。\n鹏鵾诚未忆，谁谓凌风翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}